{
  "name": "homepage",
  "display_name": "Homepage",
  "description": "Homepage 是一个高度可定制的现代化应用导航页（仪表盘），支持 Docker 服务自动发现、上百种服务 API 集成与书签管理，为你的 NAS 提供统一的入口页面。",
  "category": "tool",
  "tags": ["工具", "导航页", "仪表盘", "自托管", "开源"],
  "website": "https://gethomepage.dev/",
  "source_url": "https://github.com/gethomepage/homepage",
  "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
  "image": "ghcr.io/gethomepage/homepage",
  "default_ports": [
    {"port": 3000, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "Web 界面"}
  ],
  "config_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["ports", "volumes", "homepage_env"],
    "containers": [
      {
        "name": "homepage",
        "title": "Homepage",
        "settings": [
          {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
          {"type": "volumes", "title": "存储空间设置", "fields": ["volumes"]},
          {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["homepage_env"]},
          {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
        ],
        "description": "Homepage 应用导航页"
      }
    ],
    "properties": {
      "ports": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
          "properties": {
            "protocol": {
              "enum": ["tcp", "udp"],
              "type": "string",
              "title": "协议",
              "default": "tcp"
            },
            "local_port": {
              "type": "integer",
              "title": "本地端口",
              "maximum": 65535,
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "container_port": {
              "type": "integer",
              "title": "容器端口",
              "maximum": 65535,
              "minimum": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "title": "端口设置",
        "default": [
          {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 3000, "container_port": 3000}
        ]
      },
      "volumes": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["host_path", "container_path", "mode"],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "enum": ["rw", "ro"],
              "type": "string",
              "title": "权限",
              "default": "rw"
            },
            "host_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "本地路径",
              "format": "directory"
            },
            "container_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "容器路径"
            }
          }
        },
        "title": "存储空间设置",
        "default": [
          {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "homepage/config", "container_path": "/app/config"}
        ]
      },
      "privileged": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "title": "特权模式",
        "default": false,
        "description": "一般无需开启，仅在有特殊系统调用需求时启用"
      },
      "homepage_env": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["key", "value"],
          "properties": {
            "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
            "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
          }
        },
        "title": "环境变量",
        "default": [
          {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"}
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "yaml_template": "services:\n  homepage:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in homepage_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
  "readme": "# Homepage\n\nHomepage 是一个高度可定制的现代化应用导航页（startpage / 仪表盘），支持静态 YAML 配置与 Docker 标签自动发现服务，内置上百种服务的 API 集成（状态、统计信息展示），并提供书签、搜索、主题等能力。\n\n## 使用说明\n\n1. 部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:3000` 打开导航页。\n2. 所有配置通过配置目录（容器内 `/app/config`）下的 YAML 文件管理：`services.yml`（服务分组）、`bookmarks.yml`（书签）、`widgets.yml`（信息组件）、`settings.yml`（站点设置），修改后保存即时生效。\n3. 如需通过域名或反向代理访问，请在环境变量中设置 `HOMEPAGE_ALLOWED_HOSTS`（逗号分隔的主机名列表）。\n\n## 提示\n\n如需 Docker 服务自动发现，可额外将 `/var/run/docker.sock` 以只读方式挂载进容器，并在 `docker.yml` 中配置。",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "compose",
  "backup_paths": ["/app/config"],
  "is_builtin": false
}
